      "id": "GalacticHQB2F_Text_ToGetIntoSpeech",
      "en_US": [
        "OK, to get into Master Cyrus’s\n",
        "speech... Uh, where was it now?\r",
        "At the Galactic Veilstone Building,\n",
        "that much I’m sure about.\r",
        "Go in through the door beside the\n",
        "reception counter, I think it was?\r",
        "Uh? What’d I do with that key anyway?\n",
        "Where’s it gone?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Pour assister au discours de Maître\n",
        "Hélio... Euh, c’est où déjà?\r",
        "Au Bâtiment Galaxie de Voilaroc, ça\n",
        "c’est sûr.\r",
        "Je crois qu’il faut prendre la porte\n",
        "à côté de la réception...\r",
        "Euh, qu’est-ce que j’ai fait de cette\n",
        "clé, déjà? Où est-elle passée?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQB2F_Text_FreeAllPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Team Galactic will set free all Pokémon,\n",
        "all of nature!\r",
        "Uwahahaha!\n",
        "Team Galactic will then own it all!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "La Team Galaxie libèrera tous les\n",
        "Pokémon, tous les êtres vivants!\r",
        "Et elle en profitera alors pour les\n",
        "réduire en esclavage! Mwahahaha!"
      ]
    },
